# Face_Recognition model weights. services/face-recognizer/inference.py downloads
# both from Hugging Face at runtime via hf_hub_download, so they are never
# committed here. The upstream repo tracks them with Git LFS; this repo does not
# use LFS.
/Face_Recognition/pytorch_model.bin
/Face_Recognition/yolov8s-face-lindevs.onnx

